### The Lantern Ward's cutscenes (M3 Q3, gathered in C3), in English: what their subtitles say, and who says
### it. A timeline's `subtitles` name these keys. A line reads `subtitle-<cutscene>-<what>` and a speaker
### `speaker-<who>`, the prefixes the HUD's subtitle reads them under (M3 Q4). `game_ui.ftl`'s header says
### how a string is added.

## The court's gate (`content/zones/lantern_ward/court_gate.timeline.ron`)

speaker-wanderer = Wanderer
speaker-warden = Warden of the Gate
subtitle-court-gate-quiet = The temple court. It was quiet a moment ago.
subtitle-court-gate-warning = None pass the lantern gate.
subtitle-court-gate-answer = Then I'll go through you.
